    {
      "word": "before",
      "entryGuid": "7310db5f-33dc-5a0c-b8e1-fc78aa5f2f83",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "在某時間或事件之前：before lunch（午餐前），比午餐早；與 after lunch（午餐後）對照。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.09,
          "y": 0.215
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.09,
          "y": 0.215
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "after",
      "entryGuid": "e60fdb0c-729c-50d3-b155-608f3d2b5f2c",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "在某時間或事件之後：after lunch（午餐後），比午餐晚；與 before lunch（午餐前）對照。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.255,
          "y": 0.215
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.255,
          "y": 0.215
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "from",
      "entryGuid": "99443a6f-2a84-5ac6-8608-f0a634fbf6a9",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "指出一段時間的起點，常與 to 配對：from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon（從早上九點到下午五點）。圖中 from 9:00 a.m. 是起點。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.41,
          "y": 0.215
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.41,
          "y": 0.215
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "to",
      "entryGuid": "8be6b5fd-78fa-58ca-bb30-784540380f41",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "指出 from…to… 時間範圍的終點：from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon（從早上九點到下午五點）。本圖 to 5:00 p.m. 是終點，不是「距離五點還差幾分」的用法。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.585,
          "y": 0.215
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.585,
          "y": 0.215
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "by",
      "entryGuid": "6ff0b69d-d838-598a-a758-40b4091f6989",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "最晚在指定時間完成，包含提前完成：Finish by five／Finish by 5:00 p.m.（最晚下午五點完成）。不是一直做事到五點；持續到五點用 until。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.69,
          "y": 0.215
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.69,
          "y": 0.215
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "until",
      "entryGuid": "e52f11ad-4c52-5039-80a5-07e47b7b998c",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "動作或狀態持續到指定時間：Work until five／Work until 5:00 p.m.（持續工作到下午五點）。與 by 的完成期限不同；till 也可表達此義，本場不另列目標。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.69,
          "y": 0.405
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.69,
          "y": 0.405
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "for",
      "entryGuid": "3c1456ad-62b2-58a1-bbd2-a89b24e7e02f",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "接時間長度，回答持續多久：for two hours（持續兩小時）。不指出起點；since 指起點，during 指在哪段期間內。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.11,
          "y": 0.665
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.11,
          "y": 0.665
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "since",
      "entryGuid": "5e3124e7-180d-5ff3-b83c-b1d95abaf63f",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "接過去起點，表示持續到參照時間；本例用現在完成式：I have been here since Monday.（我從星期一起就一直在這裡。）圖中 Monday → now 表示從星期一延續到現在。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.28,
          "y": 0.665
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.28,
          "y": 0.665
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "during",
      "entryGuid": "00676060-6b5b-564b-9108-e58900a36b8b",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "在某個期間或事件內：during the meeting（在會議期間）。不單靠此詞判定活動持續多久，也不表示一定整場都在做；與 for two hours 的時間長度不同。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.435,
          "y": 0.665
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.435,
          "y": 0.665
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "in",
      "entryGuid": "2b8b2b8a-9127-5565-a861-0d8c1023d61f",
      "list": "basic",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "在本圖未來句 I will be back in two hours. 中，in two hours 指從現在算起「兩小時後」回來。與第一張圖 in April 等期間用法不同；也與 within 的「最晚兩小時內」有別。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.57,
          "y": 0.665
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.57,
          "y": 0.665
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "word": "within",
      "entryGuid": "1716c62d-9d1d-510c-b7a7-779558ff5c4d",
      "list": "expert",
      "teachingPos": "prep",
      "senseZh": "在指定長度的時間內、不晚於終點：I will be back within two hours.（我會在兩小時內回來。）可以提早，也可以在兩小時的期限到達時回來；與 in two hours（兩小時後）對照。",
      "interaction": {
        "label": {
          "x": 0.775,
          "y": 0.665
        },
        "object": {
          "x": 0.775,
          "y": 0.665
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "Look at more words for time. Before lunch means earlier than lunch. After lunch means later than lunch. From and to show the start and end. Say from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon. Finish by five means finish at five or earlier. Work until five means keep working up to five. By shows when to finish, but until shows how long to keep working. For two hours tells us how long. I have been here since Monday. Since Monday tells us when the time started. It continues from Monday to now. We can talk during the meeting. During tells us when, but for tells us how long. I will be back in two hours. Here, in two hours means two hours from now. I will be back within two hours. Within two hours means no later than two hours from now. I can be back earlier, too.",
    "textZh": "看看更多表達時間的字。before lunch 表示在午餐之前。after lunch 表示在午餐之後。from 和 to 分別指出起點和終點。說 from nine in the morning to five in the afternoon，表示從早上九點到下午五點。Finish by five 表示最晚五點完成，也可以提早完成。Work until five 表示持續工作到五點。by 指出完成期限，until 則指出持續工作到何時。for two hours 告訴我們持續多久：兩小時。我從星期一起就一直在這裡。since Monday 告訴我們開始的時間是星期一。這個狀態從星期一持續到現在。我們可以在會議期間交談。during 說明在哪段期間內，for 則說明持續多久。我會在兩小時後回來。這裡的 in two hours 表示從現在算起兩小時後。我會在兩小時內回來。within two hours 表示最晚在從現在算起的兩小時內。我也可以提早回來。",
